{"info": {"address1": "Uniphos House", "address2": "Chitrakar Dhurandhar Marg, 11th Road Near Madhu Park Garden Khar (West)", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400052", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 7152 8000", "website": "https://www.upl-ltd.com", "industry": "Agricultural Inputs", "industryKey": "agricultural-inputs", "industryDisp": "Agricultural Inputs", "sector": "Basic Materials", "sectorKey": "basic-materials", "sectorDisp": "Basic Materials", "longBusinessSummary": "UPL Limited, together with its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells pesticides, insecticides, and micronutrients in India, Brazil, the United States, the United Kingdom, and internationally. It operates in three segments: Crop Protection, Seeds, and Non-Agro. The company offers herbicides, fungicides, insecticides, acaricides, seed treatment, adjuvants, bio-solutions, public health products, fumigants, soil and water technologies, agrochemical products, and other agricultural related products under the Feroce, Shenzi, Winger, and Evolution brands, as well as ProNutiva, a solution for crop protection. It also provides seeds for vegetables and crops, such as grain sorghum, forage, corn, canola, sunflower, rice, wheats, and soyas, as well as other crops, including pearl millets, biofumingants, oats, mustards, and alfalfas under the Advanta, Alta Seeds, Pacific Seeds, and Hannaford brands. In addition, the company offers industrial and specialty chemicals, such as phosphorus, cynation, phosgenation, and acrolein; other non-agricultural related products; post-harvest solutions; farmer education and engagement; environmental electronics; and apiculture services, as well as operates nurture.farm, a digital platform for growers, farming communities, and food systems. It serves input suppliers, distributors, farmers, food wholesalers/traders, food manufacturers, food retailers, consumers, industry associations, media, cooperatives, government, restaurants, agriculture chemical distributors, and non-government organisations. The company exports its products. The company was formerly known as United Phosphorus Limited and changed its name to UPL Limited in October 2013. UPL Limited was founded in 1969 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Jaidev Rajnikant Shroff B.Sc.", "age": 60, "title": "Chairman & Group CEO", "yearBorn": 1965, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 765770078, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vikram Rajnikant Shroff B.Sc., Chemistry", "age": 52, "title": "Vice-Chairman & Co-CEO of UPL Group", "yearBorn": 1973, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 382885039, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Raj Kumar Tiwari", "age": 55, "title": "Whole-Time Director", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 44400000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Bikash  Prasad", "title": "Group Chief Financial Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Toshan Ajay Tamhane", "title": "Global Chief Operating Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Rahul R. Jadhav", "age": 56, "title": "Senior General Manager of Accounts", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anurag  Gupta", "title": "Head of Investor Relations", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sandeep Mohan Deshmukh", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sujoy  Mazumdar", "title": "Group General Counsel", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. K. R. Srivastava B.Chem, DSM, PGDBMA(IIM)", "age": 67, "title": "Chief Operating Officer of Specialty Chemicals", "yearBorn": 19